{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-03-08 15:36:00', 'title': 'GENERAC SUSPENDS SALES TO RUSSIA', 'text': 'WAUKESHA, WIS., MARCH 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENERAC\xa0HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: GNRC) ("GENERAC"), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, MANUFACTURER AND PROVIDER OF ENERGY TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AND OTHER POWER PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, THE COMPANY IS TEMPORARILY SUSPENDING ITS BRANCH OPERATIONS AND SALES IN RUSSIA.'}